  "details": "This issue appeared along changes to avatar loading/initialization that came with build 1088/2021.2.1.\nWhenever you switch to a differently sized humanoid avatar and you have full body VR, during calibration your Quick Menu will not adjust it's scale to what you are switching to until you finish calibration.\nThis results in tiny Quick menu when you switch from small to big avatar and gigantic QM when vice versa. Linked is a video of me showcasing this, it doesn't seem to matter if avatars that you switch to/from are SDK 2 or 3. Y-bot is SDK2, Teacup Dragon is SDK3, Natura avatar is SDK2.\nhttps://youtu.be/6dDO9iNXu5A\nIn this video also I don't finish calibration at any point, but the same situation would occur if I would finish it.",
